43. ACID: ATOMICITY
==============================================================================

Atomicity means:

All operations succeed or all operations roll back.

EXAMPLE:

@Transactional
public void transfer(
        long sender,
        long receiver,
        BigDecimal amount) {

    debit(sender, amount);

    credit(receiver, amount);
}

If credit fails after debit:

The complete transaction rolls back.

