44. ACID: DURABILITY
==============================================================================

Durability means:

After a database transaction is successfully committed, its changes remain
persisted even after a restart or failure, according to the database's
configured durability guarantees.

Example:

Payment transaction committed

System restarts

Committed payment remains available.

